= Dear lojban group, don't get nervous about these, these are facts, only facts.

I think I'd rather use any available language where it is appropriate,
for instance, most news can be written in english or arabic (sports in
english, for instance), some Yahoo! pages may be composed in a musical
(?) language, some forums may be written in Ardano artificial
language, and we can even use lojban for some films.   I give these
instances for the sake of illustration, what I mean is that learning
*all* languages seems possible to me, because there is some attraction
law between all the ideas within the 'knowledge' realm.

If this is not possible to do this, then I am supporter of lojban
language use for all.

